WEBVTT

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:15.780
It appears Her Royal Highness has snuck out of the administrative building.

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:17.330
Her most probable destination

00:00:17.330 --> 00:00:20.450
is the Bund’s development staff complex on the island.

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:21.790
Find her!

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:24.580
Geez.

00:00:27.080 --> 00:00:29.540
Mister Postman.

00:00:29.540 --> 00:00:31.840
Thank you, Mister.

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:36.300
Will you please send this letter of mine?

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:40.850
Don’t take too long, and do it quickly.

00:00:40.850 --> 00:00:45.390
Let me tell you how many days it should take.

00:00:45.390 --> 00:00:48.310
One… Two…

00:00:48.690 --> 00:00:51.610
Three… Four…

00:00:51.910 --> 00:00:56.280
Five… Six… Seven…

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:02.490
Onee-chan, you suck.

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:04.750
I am just unused to this!

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.580
Just you watch!

00:01:06.580 --> 00:01:09.420
I’ll get over ten next time!

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.380
Only ten?

00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:13.380
What do you mean?

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:14.880
<i>At least</i> ten!

00:01:20.970 --> 00:01:24.980
One… Two… Three…

00:01:30.040 --> 00:01:32.630
It appears that, since her shocking appearance,

00:01:32.630 --> 00:01:35.440
apart from responding to summons from the Parliamentary Government,

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:37.950
she has only made contact via one-sided messages.

00:01:37.950 --> 00:01:39.200
But it appears that Mina Țepeș will finally address the worldwide media,

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:42.280
RECORDING

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:46.040
as it has been announced that she will be holding a press conference.

00:01:46.430 --> 00:01:49.840
As per your instructions, all evidence of an attack has been removed,

00:01:49.840 --> 00:01:52.850
and Shinonome Nanami will be marked as absent.

00:01:52.850 --> 00:01:54.710
Has Akira learned of this matter?

00:01:55.150 --> 00:01:57.220
I have sealed all means of communication with the outside world.

00:01:57.690 --> 00:01:58.300
Excellent.

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:01.070
Hey, Princess.

00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:04.060
Nelly-san told me to bring this to you.

00:02:07.230 --> 00:02:09.190
Thank you, Akira-san.

00:02:10.190 --> 00:02:11.940
You’re not blushing today.

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:15.480
I’ve come to realize that you’re only teasing me.

00:02:16.780 --> 00:02:18.090
Nicole Edelman
CNM BROADCASTER
That’s right.

00:02:18.090 --> 00:02:24.010
Once this special district is established, it will be something the world has never seen before.

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:27.290
And what do you think of the vampire known as Mina Țepeș?

00:02:28.890 --> 00:02:31.140
I have no comment at the moment.

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:34.250
Also, I’m sure things will become clear at the press conference.

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:37.800
Are you going to be okay during the press conference?

00:02:38.110 --> 00:02:41.300
Oh? Are you concerned for my well being?

00:02:45.110 --> 00:02:48.390
Don’t come so close. That lightblocking gel’s smell is just…

00:02:49.810 --> 00:02:51.060
You’re no fun.

00:02:52.410 --> 00:02:54.480
We are being extra careful with security.

00:02:54.830 --> 00:02:58.580
We have performed a thorough inspection on every reporter who has entered the island.

00:02:58.580 --> 00:03:00.550
Starting from their luggage and accessories,

00:03:00.550 --> 00:03:04.090
to checking for foreign substances within their body, we checked everything…

00:03:05.340 --> 00:03:07.950
And, of course, whether or not they’re human.

00:03:12.220 --> 00:03:12.670
Yes?

00:03:13.850 --> 00:03:14.750
Your Highness.

00:03:16.440 --> 00:03:18.630
So, that old fox has arrived.

00:03:19.270 --> 00:03:21.760
I thought it was about time for him to.

00:03:29.950 --> 00:03:32.350
It has been a while, Juneau.

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:34.200
Your Majesty.

00:03:34.200 --> 00:03:37.280
To be able to stand before you again,

00:03:37.280 --> 00:03:39.780
I, Juneau Dermailles, am filled with joy.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:44.340
Your manner of speaking is as fallacious as ever.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:45.050
Well?

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:46.780
What business brings you here today?

00:03:47.220 --> 00:03:48.510
May we speak alone?

00:03:48.510 --> 00:03:51.750
It isn’t something dogs should hear.

00:03:52.050 --> 00:03:56.850
Werewolves are descended from a lineage of knights, which have long protected the Royal Family.

00:03:56.850 --> 00:03:59.250
That was quite disrespectful.

00:04:00.520 --> 00:04:04.010
They’re mere parasites born from the blood of a dog and a lowly human.

00:04:10.660 --> 00:04:11.810
Wolf-sama…

00:04:14.620 --> 00:04:20.420
The role of Her Majesty’s bodyguards will henceforth be left to my soldiers.

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.320
There is no place here for you dogs.

00:04:23.130 --> 00:04:27.570
Return to your forest and go find yourselves a new owner.

00:04:31.090 --> 00:04:32.970
Who the hell is that old man?

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.220
Marquis Juneau Dermailles.

00:04:35.220 --> 00:04:39.710
He is the current head of the family that has served the Țepeș for generations.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.810
Forgive me, Wolf-sama.

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:45.220
If I had lost my temper, I would have only played into his hands.

00:04:46.380 --> 00:04:51.970
The reason for his sudden appearance was most likely so he could secure his position on the Bund,

00:04:51.970 --> 00:04:54.870
once he had realized it was something that he could not ignore.

00:04:54.870 --> 00:04:57.100
In other words, his actions are working in our favor.

00:04:57.540 --> 00:04:58.730
Yes, they are.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:01.540
In that case,

00:05:01.540 --> 00:05:04.030
we should only do what we must…

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:05.530
…Vera-dono.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:18.310
By the way, have you had a proper talk with Wolf-sama yet?

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:19.390
Not at all.

00:05:20.230 --> 00:05:22.890
The fact that he’s my dad hasn’t really set in yet.

00:05:27.630 --> 00:05:30.400
But I must say, I was quite surprised.

00:05:30.400 --> 00:05:31.190
Pardon?

00:05:31.190 --> 00:05:33.970
The world of vampires isn’t as simple as I thought.

00:05:34.870 --> 00:05:36.720
The authority of the Royal Family is absolute.

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:40.070
Because of that authority, vampires will feud over power as rigorously…

00:05:40.070 --> 00:05:44.960
No. Rather, they will feud over power even more rigorously than humans do.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:48.000
The establishment of this territory is Her Highness’ dearest wish.

00:05:48.000 --> 00:05:52.870
Under no circumstances will I allow anyone to take advantage of it, nor will I allow them to hinder its process.

00:05:53.700 --> 00:05:57.140
For her sake, I will do anything.

00:05:57.140 --> 00:05:57.950
<i>Anything</i>.

00:05:59.140 --> 00:06:00.250
Can I ask you something?

00:06:01.640 --> 00:06:03.730
Why are you so devoted?

00:06:03.730 --> 00:06:06.250
Her Highness is my everything.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.340
I could ask you the same thing, Akira-san.

00:06:10.340 --> 00:06:16.140
Do you believe that you are adequate, and that you are a servant worthy of Her Highness?

00:06:17.950 --> 00:06:19.980
Well, I already promised her.

00:06:21.450 --> 00:06:23.410
I don’t know if I’m worthy.

00:06:23.410 --> 00:06:23.980
But…

00:06:25.480 --> 00:06:27.650
…I’ll simply do what I can for now.

00:06:37.260 --> 00:06:39.680
It’s a helicopter that’s under Marquis Dermailles’ authority.

00:06:39.680 --> 00:06:40.960
So, they’ve already arrived.

00:06:46.210 --> 00:06:48.340
There’s a ton of them.

00:06:50.400 --> 00:06:53.240
Yet that won’t be quite enough.

00:07:01.700 --> 00:07:02.740
Really?

00:07:10.090 --> 00:07:14.280
The one who assaulted Her Highness the other day was a vampire.

00:07:14.920 --> 00:07:16.120
Correct?

00:07:16.550 --> 00:07:17.220
Yes.

00:07:19.970 --> 00:07:24.120
In reality, such a thing should never occur.

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:26.920
Because the Princess’ authority is absolute?

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:30.460
There’s a much more important reason for it.

00:07:34.230 --> 00:07:38.890
For the Royals of the Night to reside in this tiny corner of Asia…

00:07:39.660 --> 00:07:41.890
Those dogs are disgracing us!

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:46.650
Your Excellency!

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:49.480
What did you say?!

00:07:53.440 --> 00:07:55.950
It was stolen? The bomb?!

00:07:57.840 --> 00:07:59.470
More important?

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:02.450
To us, the death of Her Highness…

00:08:02.810 --> 00:08:05.330
…implies the death of our race itself.

00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:15.550
The wind appears to have started up.

00:08:29.710 --> 00:08:33.630
Today at the Central Administrative Center of Tokyo Land Reclamation #0,

00:08:33.630 --> 00:08:38.400
there will be a historical, never before seen press conference.

00:08:39.130 --> 00:08:46.510
What does the owner of this island, and the supposed Queen of the Vampires, have to tell us?

00:08:52.340 --> 00:08:56.710
Thank you for coming here tonight upon my invitation.

00:08:57.200 --> 00:09:00.720
I hereby vow to answer any and all questions in full detail.

00:09:00.720 --> 00:09:03.350
Feel free to ask me anything.

00:09:04.120 --> 00:09:05.350
It has begun.

00:09:05.910 --> 00:09:07.980
So carelessly, after that grand failure.

00:09:08.370 --> 00:09:09.690
Let’s go, Vera-san.

00:09:09.690 --> 00:09:12.190
We need to clean up after their mess.

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:15.860
According to the results of the investigation,

00:09:15.860 --> 00:09:18.610
one of the men I had brought over

00:09:18.610 --> 00:09:20.820
has seemingly gone missing.

00:09:21.300 --> 00:09:23.950
Are you suggesting he took the bomb?

00:09:24.340 --> 00:09:25.220
Yes.

00:09:25.220 --> 00:09:28.430
But this missing man is someone rather new,

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:29.960
who was hired right before we departed.

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:33.380
It is unclear as to what his lineage is.

00:09:33.770 --> 00:09:36.000
So, you do not know his identity?

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:37.130
Yes, ma’am.

00:09:37.690 --> 00:09:38.940
In regards to this matter,

00:09:38.940 --> 00:09:41.630
I had received word on far too short notice.

00:09:41.630 --> 00:09:44.080
If only I had been informed earlier,

00:09:44.080 --> 00:09:47.890
I would have had time to properly select the guards.

00:09:48.720 --> 00:09:50.620
We have a missing bomb!

00:09:50.620 --> 00:09:51.940
That excuse is hardly—

00:09:51.940 --> 00:09:53.310
Silence, servant!

00:09:53.830 --> 00:09:55.670
Even you must be aware!

00:09:55.670 --> 00:09:58.470
The lineage of the bomb thief may be unknown,

00:09:58.470 --> 00:10:00.210
but we do know it was a vampire!

00:10:00.210 --> 00:10:02.820
Are you suggesting a vampire seeks to harm Her Majesty?

00:10:03.380 --> 00:10:05.200
That there’s such a vampire?!

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:07.420
In that case,

00:10:07.420 --> 00:10:10.700
we are lucky that the thief is a vampire we can identify.

00:10:11.350 --> 00:10:13.930
In fact, because we have this information,

00:10:13.930 --> 00:10:16.100
it has become much easier to protect Her Majesty.

00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:17.520
You’re spouting nonsense—

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:18.460
Enough.

00:10:19.940 --> 00:10:22.050
The press conference will be held as planned.

00:10:22.610 --> 00:10:26.200
You are to be in charge of security, Dermailles.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:26.800
Ma’am.

00:10:27.160 --> 00:10:28.060
Princess.

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:33.960
Geez.

00:10:34.370 --> 00:10:35.940
She knows no fear.

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:39.520
So, where’s the bomb?

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:42.440
We are investigating, but haven’t found it.

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:45.880
There are hardly any people on the island,

00:10:45.880 --> 00:10:48.910
so there are tons of places to hide, huh?

00:10:49.300 --> 00:10:52.750
But it is meaningless to remain in hiding.

00:10:53.140 --> 00:10:57.710
Given the timing of the bomb theft, he must be planning to use it soon.

00:10:58.270 --> 00:10:59.860
Where could the bomb be?

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:09.930
It can’t be…

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:14.480
To begin, I would like to represent all of the assembled media, and ask the first question.

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:19.540
First, um… Regarding the special region, what did the Japanese Government—

00:11:22.380 --> 00:11:23.670
Um…

00:11:23.670 --> 00:11:25.010
Forgive me.

00:11:25.010 --> 00:11:27.990
I had imagined that the first question would be very different.

00:11:28.470 --> 00:11:32.040
Something like, “Are you really a vampire?”

00:11:33.430 --> 00:11:40.230
Of those of you here, I would say about half of you believe the events that occurred on Astraea’s Balance.

00:11:40.230 --> 00:11:41.270
Nay.

00:11:41.270 --> 00:11:46.360
Rather, I should say that probably less than half of this lot believe it.

00:11:46.360 --> 00:11:48.950
Of course, that is perfectly fine, too.

00:11:48.950 --> 00:11:51.530
What you must really be wondering, at this moment,

00:11:51.530 --> 00:11:53.600
is how a little girl such as myself

00:11:53.600 --> 00:11:56.780
was able to so successfully negotiate with Japan,

00:11:56.780 --> 00:12:00.440
and what scheme she used to obtain this Bund.

00:12:00.440 --> 00:12:02.070
Something to that effect?

00:12:03.250 --> 00:12:04.070
Yes.

00:12:04.070 --> 00:12:05.130
That’s the deepest mystery.

00:12:05.130 --> 00:12:05.800
A “Bund”?

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:07.590
There must be a large sum of money involved.

00:12:07.590 --> 00:12:10.070
That’s what we call Shanghai’s coastal area.

00:12:12.140 --> 00:12:13.740
The answer is simple.

00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:15.620
Money.

00:12:16.430 --> 00:12:18.810
As a result of the economic blunders of the previous administration,

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:21.980
this country was left with a national debt of one thousand trillion yen.

00:12:21.980 --> 00:12:23.880
To prevent you from defaulting,

00:12:23.880 --> 00:12:27.170
we made preparations to pay off the entire debt.

00:12:27.490 --> 00:12:31.660
In recent years, the Japanese economy has been on the rise.

00:12:31.660 --> 00:12:32.680
But were you aware?

00:12:33.070 --> 00:12:39.000
It is mainly because we took the initiative, and transferred multiple affiliated companies into the country,

00:12:39.000 --> 00:12:41.030
began the construction of this Land Reclamation #0,

00:12:41.030 --> 00:12:44.940
and also heavily invested in many other large-scale construction projects.

00:12:45.670 --> 00:12:47.940
Leveling the ground, perhaps?

00:12:48.420 --> 00:12:51.950
But to have a country with such a weak foundation related to my territory…

00:12:52.420 --> 00:12:54.450
…is actually rather inconvenient.

00:12:54.450 --> 00:12:58.070
In the event that approval for the establishment of our district is not obtained,

00:12:58.070 --> 00:13:00.960
I will pull out all the companies that I have introduced.

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:02.460
That’s a threat!

00:13:02.810 --> 00:13:06.480
Where would you find a fool that would provide service for no profit?

00:13:06.480 --> 00:13:10.590
We did not come to this land to be generous philanthropists.

00:13:11.200 --> 00:13:17.600
I hereby declare, and formally state my demands to the Japanese government, as well as its dearest citizens.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:20.960
The ownership of this Reclamation Land #0.

00:13:20.960 --> 00:13:24.290
The buildings and the land already belong to me,

00:13:24.290 --> 00:13:29.670
but I demand for this land to be officially administered to us as a concession.

00:13:29.670 --> 00:13:32.170
Without question, it will be granted for an indefinite amount of time,

00:13:32.170 --> 00:13:35.240
and we will have the right to autonomy and police powers.

00:13:36.260 --> 00:13:37.060
Yes.

00:13:37.060 --> 00:13:40.680
A concession, like how Hong Kong and Shanghai were in the past.

00:13:40.680 --> 00:13:43.810
Land that is within a country while being part of another.

00:13:43.810 --> 00:13:47.980
A transient city that brings about confusion from the mix of different cultures.

00:13:47.980 --> 00:13:49.980
That is my desire.

00:13:49.980 --> 00:13:54.030
A kingdom of vampires by vampires for vampires.

00:13:54.490 --> 00:13:56.300
The Vampire Bund!

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:01.870
What do you want at such an important time?

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:02.620
Old man!

00:14:02.620 --> 00:14:03.230
Old ma—

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:05.000
Who are you, you mongrel?

00:14:05.000 --> 00:14:06.230
Just shut up and listen!

00:14:06.580 --> 00:14:08.360
Did you check all the reporters?

00:14:08.670 --> 00:14:10.510
Of course.

00:14:10.510 --> 00:14:14.740
We also thoroughly inspected their bodies and even the equipment they carried.

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:16.320
What about if they were human?!

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:20.790
Did you check if there were any vampires among the reporters?

00:14:21.180 --> 00:14:23.060
Why would I do such a thing?

00:14:23.060 --> 00:14:24.790
There shouldn’t be any need to!

00:14:24.790 --> 00:14:25.540
Damn it.

00:14:26.690 --> 00:14:27.250
Akira-san!

00:14:27.730 --> 00:14:28.710
What’s going—

00:14:28.710 --> 00:14:30.530
I smelled it.

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:33.420
There was a reporter wearing lightblocking gel!

00:14:34.740 --> 00:14:37.550
But they were all humans when they came to the island.

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.050
Then they changed.

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:40.370
That can’t be!

00:14:40.370 --> 00:14:41.680
Unfortunately, it can.

00:14:42.410 --> 00:14:47.790
One of the reporters, one who arrived as a human, turned into a vampire.

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.060
But why would they do that?

00:14:49.420 --> 00:14:51.250
Because vampires can…

00:14:51.250 --> 00:14:55.070
Rather, only vampires can conceal a bomb in a certain way!

00:14:58.930 --> 00:14:59.700
Vera-dono.

00:15:00.260 --> 00:15:03.450
I have just received word that large quantities of blood,

00:15:03.450 --> 00:15:08.460
as well as a part of an organ were just found inside one of the reporters’ rooms.

00:15:08.860 --> 00:15:09.460
Whose?

00:15:09.770 --> 00:15:13.340
CNM’s reporter, Nicole Edelman.

00:15:13.340 --> 00:15:19.010
Then tell us, how is it possible that you are able to pay off this astronomical sum of one thousand trillion yen?

00:15:20.070 --> 00:15:28.370
Our kind has been ruling this world since your ancestors were still in the Stone Age.

00:15:28.370 --> 00:15:32.730
That “astronomical amount” is merely the tip of a mountain.

00:15:32.730 --> 00:15:35.340
And we’re back to this.

00:15:35.340 --> 00:15:39.780
That is all based on the assumption that you are a vampire as you claim!

00:15:40.800 --> 00:15:43.030
We are finally on this topic.

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:48.810
But alas, I have no means to prove that I am a vampire.

00:15:48.810 --> 00:15:55.050
I couldn’t possibly walk under the sun or be staked through the heart in this situation to prove it.

00:15:55.400 --> 00:15:59.590
Perhaps I should suck the blood of one amongst you?

00:16:03.370 --> 00:16:06.850
You dare to ask me to suck your blood?

00:16:07.500 --> 00:16:10.810
That is only if you are truly the Queen of the Vampires.

00:16:12.250 --> 00:16:14.320
You jest, fool.

00:16:14.750 --> 00:16:17.690
I have no need to even take your blood.

00:16:34.500 --> 00:16:34.960
Vera-san!

00:16:39.130 --> 00:16:40.420
Slice her stomach open!

00:16:40.780 --> 00:16:43.260
There’s no time…

00:16:43.260 --> 00:16:44.140
…for that!

00:16:57.340 --> 00:16:58.650
It’s already been activated!

00:16:58.650 --> 00:17:00.360
Akira-san, dismantle it!

00:17:00.360 --> 00:17:01.240
What?!

00:17:01.240 --> 00:17:05.200
Soldiers of the wolf lineage should be trained to deactivate a bomb.

00:17:05.950 --> 00:17:08.390
I don’t remember any of that!

00:17:08.770 --> 00:17:09.480
Run away!

00:17:11.480 --> 00:17:12.850
Y-Your Highness!

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:13.710
We must evacuate.

00:17:14.230 --> 00:17:16.380
Do not panic, you fools!

00:17:17.980 --> 00:17:19.900
Wolf, can you hear me?

00:17:19.900 --> 00:17:20.700
Yes.

00:17:20.700 --> 00:17:21.670
Use it.

00:17:22.360 --> 00:17:23.070
Understood.

00:17:23.070 --> 00:17:25.090
Akira, the third elevator.

00:17:25.780 --> 00:17:27.050
We’ve stopped the elevator.

00:17:27.370 --> 00:17:29.600
Now throw it into the elevator shaft!

00:17:31.250 --> 00:17:33.140
The underground facilities will be fine.

00:17:33.140 --> 00:17:34.000
Do it!

00:17:37.000 --> 00:17:38.670
Open the door!

00:17:54.900 --> 00:17:57.110
It went off, right?

00:17:57.110 --> 00:17:59.290
Vera-san, what’s under here?

00:17:59.980 --> 00:18:01.550
You’ll find out soon enough.

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:08.340
It appears that I have just strangely proven the existence of vampires.

00:18:08.740 --> 00:18:11.580
Journalists, remember what you just saw with your eyes,

00:18:11.580 --> 00:18:13.230
what you just heard with your ears,

00:18:13.230 --> 00:18:15.230
and report it to the entire world!

00:18:15.630 --> 00:18:17.730
This is our world.

00:18:17.730 --> 00:18:21.230
We live in the dark, ruled only by blood and death.

00:18:21.550 --> 00:18:23.480
But do be rest assured.

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:31.200
So long as you remain a good neighbor, we will never become a threat.

00:18:31.200 --> 00:18:34.940
So long as you remain that way, that is.

00:18:34.940 --> 00:18:37.210
That is all I have to say.

00:18:37.210 --> 00:18:40.210
Now, return to your own world.

00:18:42.690 --> 00:18:48.990
Prime Minister, we have just received the Special District Establishment Bill from the anti-partisan union!

00:18:51.290 --> 00:18:54.810
Are you sure you did the right thing with that Dermailles guy?

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:58.040
You could’ve fired him or demoted him.

00:18:58.040 --> 00:18:59.750
He is just a small man.

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:04.010
He lacks the courage to kill me and end our history.

00:19:04.010 --> 00:19:05.570
You can trust him in that regard.

00:19:05.930 --> 00:19:10.350
However, Juneau can now never talk lowly of werewolves.

00:19:10.350 --> 00:19:11.570
Keep doing your best.

00:19:12.010 --> 00:19:14.490
You did that for us?

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:16.600
I was happy.

00:19:16.600 --> 00:19:21.000
You risked your life and fought for my sake.

00:19:21.650 --> 00:19:23.680
Just like the one I knew in the past…

00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:26.010
…the Kaburagi Akira I knew.

00:19:27.780 --> 00:19:31.260
I guess that Dermailles wasn’t the only one being tested.

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:35.080
You are still testing me as well, are you not?

00:19:35.080 --> 00:19:35.930
That makes us even.

00:19:42.210 --> 00:19:44.670
I’m getting even more confused.

00:19:44.670 --> 00:19:45.520
About you, that is.

00:19:48.510 --> 00:19:51.490
One moment, you’re threatening a country.

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:54.280
Another, you’re getting frustrated at jump rope.

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:57.480
You saw that?

00:19:57.480 --> 00:20:00.410
Until you could finally jump ten times.

00:20:01.900 --> 00:20:06.500
I was merely playing with the children because they had insisted so fervently!

00:20:06.860 --> 00:20:09.720
But you had a nice expression there, Princess.

00:20:11.990 --> 00:20:16.000
Seeing you play with human kids like that, it was almost like…

00:20:16.000 --> 00:20:18.720
They aren’t human.

00:20:19.470 --> 00:20:21.790
They are the Fangless.

00:20:21.790 --> 00:20:26.650
Those who chose to remove their fangs, and refuse to drink human blood.

00:20:28.220 --> 00:20:34.410
Among those who are aiding in the construction of the Bund, there are actually quite a number of them.

00:20:34.410 --> 00:20:38.450
Even upon becoming vampires, they choose to cherish the hearts of men,

00:20:39.060 --> 00:20:44.480
all the while being persecuted by humans and vampires alike for their way of life,

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:46.330
and forced to wander from one place to another.

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:52.670
But once the Bund is completed, no one will ever disturb their peace again.

00:20:53.660 --> 00:20:56.510
Is that why you’re constructing the Bund?

00:20:57.410 --> 00:20:59.260
If only it were…

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:04.390
On that day, the world learned of vampires.

00:21:04.790 --> 00:21:08.650
Even those who had ignored them as an incident at the edge of Asia…

00:21:08.650 --> 00:21:15.150
Even those who had ridiculed them as a fabricated existence born from television…

00:21:15.550 --> 00:21:19.660
They were all forced to accept and believe their existence.

00:21:20.020 --> 00:21:27.240
As for the repercussions that were fast approaching us, which had been born from that quiet shockwave…

00:21:27.240 --> 00:21:33.530
Neither I, nor even Akira-kun, would realize it at the time.

00:21:34.970 --> 00:21:37.390
Dance with the Vampire Maids.

00:21:37.390 --> 00:21:38.470
Part Four!

00:21:38.470 --> 00:21:40.020
How may I help you today?

00:21:40.020 --> 00:21:40.850
Well…

00:21:40.850 --> 00:21:44.560
I lost my memory or something and don’t even remember my dad’s face.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:48.850
I really don’t have the confidence to keep going, and everyone around is kind of scary.

00:21:48.850 --> 00:21:49.860
Don’t worry!

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:51.240
You’re a passive person.

00:21:51.240 --> 00:21:52.490
You’re a really passive person.

00:21:52.490 --> 00:21:54.530
Your memory loss only adds character.

00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:55.450
In fact, it’s your strong point!

00:21:55.450 --> 00:21:56.870
Keep honing that character!

00:21:56.870 --> 00:21:57.830
Take care.

00:21:57.830 --> 00:21:58.740
Next person.

00:21:58.740 --> 00:22:00.660
There’s a maid who doesn’t take her job seriously.

00:22:00.660 --> 00:22:01.830
What should we do?

00:22:01.830 --> 00:22:03.490
My, that sounds like a problem.

00:22:03.490 --> 00:22:05.000
We’re talking about you!
